# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
/gen/schemas

# Vendored at build time, never committed. See binaries/README.md.
#
# The runtime libraries come down with the binary and are just as much not
# ours to commit: they are Qt's and Microsoft's, they are tens of megabytes,
# and the release they come from is the record of which build they belong to.
binaries/*
!binaries/README.md
